\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \fi720\li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8262002 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\fs24\insrsid8262002\charrsid2973878 Kemudian Ketua Majel
